msgid "System Updates"
msgstr "Ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update"
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update"

msgid "Keep Fluff Linux secure and up to date by installing system updates."
msgstr "Cùm Fluff Linux sàbhailte agus ùraichte le bhith a' stàladh ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim."

msgid "System last updated: %1 (%2)"
msgstr "Chaidh an siostam ùrachadh mu dheireadh: %1 (%2)"

msgid "Check for Updates"
msgstr "Thoir sùil airson ùrachaidhean"

msgid "Install Updates"
msgstr "Stàlaich ùrachaidhean"

msgid "View Updates"
msgstr "Seall ùrachaidhean"

msgid "Change view"
msgstr "Atharraich an sealladh"

msgid "Updates to Install"
msgstr "Ùrachaidhean ri stàladh"

msgid "Package details are unavailable."
msgstr "Chan eil mion-fhiosrachadh nam pacaidean ri fhaighinn."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update is still under development. If you encounter an issue, please report it on our GitHub page."
msgstr "Tha Fluff Linux Update fhathast ga leasachadh. Ma thachras duilgheadas dhut, cuir aithisg air an duilleag GitHub againn."

msgid "System updates were installed successfully."
msgstr "Chaidh ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim a stàladh gu soirbheachail."

msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

msgid "No network connection!"
msgstr "Chan eil ceangal lìonra ann!"

msgid "Network connection is limited. If you are not connected to an organizational network, please check your internet connection."
msgstr "Tha an ceangal lìonra cuingichte. Mur eil thu ceangailte ri lìonra buidhne, thoir sùil air a' cheangal eadar-lìn agad."

msgid "pacman process is already running."
msgstr "Tha pròiseas pacman a' ruith mu thràth."

msgid "The update process could not be started."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn pròiseas an ùrachaidh a thòiseachadh."

msgid "The update process could not be cancelled."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn pròiseas an ùrachaidh a chur dheth."

msgid "Connection failed while downloading updates. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Dh'fhàillig an ceangal fhad 's a bha na h-ùrachaidhean gan luchdadh a-nuas. Thoir sùil air an lìonra is feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The system update failed."
msgstr "Dh'fhàillig ùrachadh an t-siostaim."

msgid "Downloading updates…"
msgstr "A' luchdadh ùrachaidhean a-nuas…"

msgid "Installing updates…"
msgstr "A' stàladh ùrachaidhean…"

msgid "%1 / %2 downloaded"
msgstr "%1 / %2 air a luchdadh a-nuas"

msgid "%1/%2 updates installed"
msgstr "%1/%2 ùrachaidhean air an stàladh"

msgid "Updates are currently being installed. Please avoid powering off or restarting the computer until installation is complete. Interrupting the update may damage system files."
msgstr "Tha ùrachaidhean gan stàladh. Na cuir an coimpiutair dheth agus na ath-thòisich e gus am bi an stàladh deiseil. Faodaidh stad air an ùrachadh faidhlichean an t-siostaim a mhilleadh."

msgid "The battery is low. Please connect your computer to a charger while installing updates."
msgstr "Tha am bataraidh ìosal. Ceangail an coimpiutair ri inneal-teairrdsidh fhad 's a tha ùrachaidhean gan stàladh."

msgid "Update process was cancelled"
msgstr "Chaidh pròiseas an ùrachaidh a chur dheth"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Sguir dheth"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "A' lorg ùrachaidhean…"

msgid "System updates are available"
msgstr "Tha ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim ri fhaighinn"

msgid "Download size: %1"
msgstr "Meud an luchdaidh a-nuas: %1"

msgid "Storage required for system updates: %1"
msgstr "Àite-stòrais a tha a dhìth airson ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim: %1"

msgid "Storage freed after update: %1"
msgstr "Àite-stòrais a thèid a shaoradh às dèidh an ùrachaidh: %1"

msgid "No additional download required"
msgstr "Chan eil luchdadh a-nuas a bharrachd a dhìth"

msgid "The update checker could not be started. Make sure pacman-contrib is installed."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn lorgaire nan ùrachaidhean a thòiseachadh. Dèan cinnteach gu bheil pacman-contrib stàlaichte."

msgid "The update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Stad sgrùdadh nan ùrachaidhean gun dùil."

msgid "An unknown error has occurred. Please report this issue on our GitHub page for assistance."
msgstr "Thachair mearachd neo-aithnichte. Cuir aithisg air an duilleag GitHub againn airson cuideachadh."

msgid "No internet connection. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Chan eil ceangal eadar-lìn ann. Thoir sùil air an lìonra is feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The repository servers could not be reached. Try again later or check your mirror configuration."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn frithealaichean nan tasglann a ruigsinn. Feuch ris nas anmoiche no thoir sùil air roghainnean nan sgàthan."

msgid "Authorization error, please try again."
msgstr "Mearachd ceadachaidh. Feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The privileged update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Stad sgrùdadh nan ùrachaidhean le sochairean àrda gun dùil."

msgid "The privileged update check could not be started."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn sgrùdadh nan ùrachaidhean le sochairean àrda a thòiseachadh."

msgid "System was not previously updated."
msgstr "Cha deach an siostam ùrachadh roimhe."

msgid "The last update information could not be read."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn fiosrachadh an ùrachaidh mu dheireadh a leughadh."

msgid "The last update information is invalid."
msgstr "Tha fiosrachadh an ùrachaidh mu dheireadh mì-dhligheach."

msgid "Updates were not installed on this system"
msgstr "Cha deach ùrachaidhean a stàladh air an t-siostam seo"

msgid "To update the system, check for available updates using the button below."
msgstr "Airson an siostam ùrachadh, lorg ùrachaidhean leis a' phutan gu h-ìosal."

msgid "Update date available"
msgstr "Tha ceann-là ùrachaidh ri fhaighinn"

msgid "Updated recently"
msgstr "Air ùrachadh o chionn ghoirid"

msgid "System is up to date"
msgstr "Tha an siostam ùraichte"

msgid "Last update was installed more than a month ago"
msgstr "Chaidh an t-ùrachadh mu dheireadh a stàladh còrr is mìos air ais"

msgid "Last update was installed more than three months ago"
msgstr "Chaidh an t-ùrachadh mu dheireadh a stàladh còrr is trì mìosan air ais"

msgid "%1 second ago"
msgid_plural "%1 seconds ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 diog air ais"
msgstr[1] "%1 dhiog air ais"
msgstr[2] "%1 diogan air ais"
msgstr[3] "%1 diog air ais"

msgid "%1 minute ago"
msgid_plural "%1 minutes ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 mionaid air ais"
msgstr[1] "%1 mhionaid air ais"
msgstr[2] "%1 mionaidean air ais"
msgstr[3] "%1 mionaid air ais"

msgid "%1 hour ago"
msgid_plural "%1 hours ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 uair air ais"
msgstr[1] "%1 uair air ais"
msgstr[2] "%1 uairean air ais"
msgstr[3] "%1 uair air ais"

msgid "%1 day ago"
msgid_plural "%1 days ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 latha air ais"
msgstr[1] "%1 latha air ais"
msgstr[2] "%1 làithean air ais"
msgstr[3] "%1 latha air ais"

msgid "Action is required"
msgstr "Tha gnìomh a dhìth"

msgid "Action is required!"
msgstr "Tha gnìomh a dhìth!"

msgid "Action required"
msgstr "Gnìomh a dhìth"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update cannot continue because the upcoming update requires removing “%1”, which is a protected system package. Removing it could prevent Fluff Linux from working correctly. Please report this issue on GitHub for assistance."
msgstr "Chan urrainn do Fluff Linux Update leantainn air adhart oir tha an ath ùrachadh ag iarraidh gun tèid “%1”, pacaid dhìonta an t-siostaim, a thoirt air falbh. Dh'fhaodadh seo bacadh a chur air Fluff Linux bho bhith ag obair gu ceart. Cuir aithisg air GitHub airson cuideachadh."

msgid "To allow the system to install updates, Fluff Linux Update needs to remove “%1”. Removing this package may affect related software. If you are not sure, please report the issue on GitHub for help."
msgstr "Airson ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim a stàladh, feumaidh Fluff Linux Update “%1” a thoirt air falbh. Dh'fhaodadh seo buaidh a thoirt air bathar-bog co-cheangailte. Mur eil thu cinnteach, cuir aithisg air GitHub airson cuideachadh."

msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Gabh ris"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Dùin"

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, %1 was automatically removed after it was deemed safe to remove."
msgstr "Airson leantainn air adhart le ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim, chaidh %1 a thoirt air falbh gu fèin-obrachail an dèidh measadh gun robh e sàbhailte sin a dhèanamh."

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, the following packages were automatically removed after they were deemed safe to remove: %1"
msgstr "Airson leantainn air adhart le ùrachaidhean an t-siostaim, chaidh na pacaidean seo a thoirt air falbh gu fèin-obrachail an dèidh measadh gun robh e sàbhailte sin a dhèanamh: %1"

msgid "A file conflict was detected and resolved. %1 was renamed to %2. The update process has restarted."
msgstr "Chaidh còmhstri fhaidhlichean a lorg is a rèiteach. Chaidh %1 ath-ainmeachadh gu %2. Tha pròiseas an ùrachaidh air tòiseachadh a-rithist."

msgid "The conflicting package could not be removed. Please seek support."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn a' phacaid a tha ann an còmhstri a thoirt air falbh. Iarr taic."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn do Fluff Linux Update iuchair soidhnidh tasglann FluffNet a dhearbhadh. Chaidh an t-ùrachadh a stad gus an siostam a dhìon."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system. This may indicate a network problem, an unavailable FluffNet server, an expired or rotated signing key, a repository configuration problem, an unexpected key, or a possible repository compromise. Do not manually accept an unexpected key unless Fluff Linux publishes verified instructions."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn do Fluff Linux Update iuchair soidhnidh tasglann FluffNet a dhearbhadh. Chaidh an t-ùrachadh a stad gus an siostam a dhìon. Dh'fhaodadh seo a bhith na dhuilgheadas lìonra, frithealaiche FluffNet nach eil ri fhaighinn, iuchair a dh'fhalbh an ùine oirre no a chaidh a chur na h-àite, duilgheadas rèiteachaidh tasglainn, iuchair ris nach robh dùil, no ionnsaigh air an tasglann. Na gabh ri iuchair ris nach robh dùil a làimh mur foillsich Fluff Linux stiùireadh air a dhearbhadh."

msgid "Repository: %1"
msgstr "Tasglann: %1"

msgid "The official FluffNet repository signing key was verified and added to Pacman."
msgstr "Chaidh iuchair soidhnidh oifigeil tasglann FluffNet a dhearbhadh is a chur ri Pacman."

msgid "Technical details"
msgstr "Mion-fhiosrachadh teicnigeach"

msgid "Repository signing-key verification technical details"
msgstr "Mion-fhiosrachadh teicnigeach mu dhearbhadh iuchair soidhnidh an tasglainn"

msgid "Failure category: %1"
msgstr "Roinn-seòrsa na fàilligeadh: %1"

msgid "Expected fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Lorg-meòir ris an robh dùil: %1"

msgid "Received fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Lorg-meòir a fhuaradh: %1"

msgid "Requested signing-key fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Lorg-meòir na h-iuchrach soidhnidh a chaidh iarraidh: %1"

msgid "Pacman exit status: %1"
msgstr "Staid fàgail Pacman: %1"

msgid "FLU version: %1"
msgstr "Tionndadh FLU: %1"

msgid "Fluff Linux version: %1"
msgstr "Tionndadh Fluff Linux: %1"

msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Feuch ris a-rithist"

msgid "Copy Technical Details"
msgstr "Dèan lethbhreac dhen mhion-fhiosrachadh teicnigeach"

msgid "Open an Issue on GitHub"
msgstr "Fosgail cùis air GitHub"

msgid "There is not enough free storage to continue the update. Free up space and try again."
msgstr "Chan eil àite-stòrais saor gu leòr ann airson leantainn air adhart. Saor àite is feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "A package or repository signature could not be verified. The update was stopped. Check your system date and keyring, then try again."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn soidhneadh pacaid no tasglainn a dhearbhadh. Chaidh an t-ùrachadh a stad. Thoir sùil air ceann-là an t-siostaim is an cearcall-iuchraichean, agus feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The package database is damaged or unreadable. The update was stopped. Please seek support before repairing the database."
msgstr "Tha stòr-dàta nam pacaidean millte no cha ghabh a leughadh. Chaidh an t-ùrachadh a stad. Iarr taic mus càraich thu an stòr-dàta."

msgid "A downloaded package is damaged or incomplete. The update was stopped. Please try again or use a different mirror."
msgstr "Tha pacaid a chaidh a luchdadh a-nuas millte no neo-iomlan. Chaidh an t-ùrachadh a stad. Feuch ris a-rithist no cleachd sgàthan eile."

msgid "The update could not read or write required files. Check filesystem permissions and disk health, then try again."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhan ùrachadh na faidhlichean a tha a dhìth a leughadh no a sgrìobhadh. Thoir sùil air ceadan an t-siostaim fhaidhlichean agus staid an diosga, agus feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The updates could not be downloaded. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn na h-ùrachaidhean a luchdadh a-nuas. Feuch ris a-rithist no iarr taic."

msgid "The update transaction could not be prepared. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn tar-ghnìomh an ùrachaidh ullachadh. Feuch ris a-rithist no iarr taic."

msgid "The update could not start because sleep prevention could not be enabled. Please try again."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhan ùrachadh tòiseachadh oir cha b' urrainn dhuinn casg a chur air cadal. Feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "The package database could not be locked. Close other package managers and check that the filesystem is writable, then try again."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn stòr-dàta nam pacaidean a ghlasadh. Dùin manaidsearan pacaid eile agus dèan cinnteach gu bheil sgrìobhadh ceadaichte san t-siostam fhaidhlichean, agus feuch ris a-rithist."

msgid "Estimated time: %1"
msgstr "Ùine mheasta: %1"
